  <!-- ===== S6 four reasons, with the real prompt in a side panel (Kalyan review 31 Oct) ===== -->
  <div class="chap" id="pps">
    <div class="rh" id="rn1"><span class="rn">1</span><span>Measure first,<br>don't guess</span></div>
    <div class="rh" id="rn2"><span class="rn">2</span><span>The stack<br>is fixed</span></div>
    <div class="rh" id="rn3"><span class="rn">3</span><span>Every part<br>of the screen</span></div>
    <div class="rh" id="rn4"><span class="rn">4</span><span>Testing</span><span class="ic" id="rn4h" style="width:52px;height:52px;color:var(--coral)">{{i:heart}}</span></div>
    <!-- reason 1: Claude's real measured values -->
    <div class="lv" id="r1v">
      <div id="r1w" style="position:relative;width:500px;height:250px;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);background:#0c0c0c;opacity:0">
        <img src="img/done.png" style="position:absolute;left:-6px;top:-226px;width:866px">
        <div id="r1hl" style="position:absolute;left:4px;top:30px;width:330px;height:22px;border:4px solid var(--coral);border-radius:8px;opacity:0"></div>
        <div style="position:absolute;right:10px;bottom:8px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(14,14,18,.85);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--mute)">Claude's report · real numbers</div></div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:22px;margin-top:26px">
        <div class="sw" id="swBlue"><div style="width:120px;height:90px;border-radius:14px;background:#2C7BD6;position:relative"><span class="ic" style="position:absolute;inset:-12px;color:var(--red)">{{i:x}}</span></div><span>"looks blue"</span></div>
        <div class="sw" id="swHex"><div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><div style="width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:14px;background:#FF9F19"></div><div style="width:90px;height:90px;border-radius:14px;background:#DEDEDE"></div></div><span class="mono hot" style="font-size:30px">#ff9f19</span></div></div></div>
    <!-- reason 2: fixed stack -->
    <div class="lv" id="r2v">
      <div class="st" id="sk1"><span class="ic">{{i:atom}}</span>React 19</div>
      <div class="st" id="sk2"><span class="ic">{{i:zap}}</span>Vite</div>
      <div class="st" id="sk3"><span class="ic">{{i:file-code}}</span>Plain CSS</div>
      <div id="sk4" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:22px;opacity:0"><div style="position:relative;width:80px;height:80px"><span class="ic" style="position:absolute;inset:0;color:var(--steel)">{{i:package}}</span><span class="ic" style="position:absolute;inset:-10px;color:var(--red)">{{i:ban}}</span></div><span style="font-weight:800;font-size:40px">No random libraries</span></div></div>
    <!-- reason 3: every part of the screen -->
    <div class="lv" id="r3v">
      <div style="position:relative;width:500px;height:330px;border-radius:18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);overflow:hidden">
        <div style="height:30px;background:rgba(232,119,95,.25)"></div>
        <div class="wl2" id="wl1" style="left:14px"><div class="wh2"></div><div class="wc2"></div><div class="wc2"></div><div class="wc2"></div></div>
        <div class="wl2" id="wl2" style="left:132px"><div class="wh2"></div><div class="wc2"></div><div class="wc2"></div></div>
        <div class="wl2" id="wl3" style="left:250px"><div class="wh2"></div><div class="wc2"></div></div>
        <div id="wp2" style="position:absolute;right:0;top:30px;width:130px;bottom:0;background:#1d1f25;border-left:2px solid var(--coral);padding:12px;box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;color:var(--coral)">Card panel<div style="height:12px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:10px"></div><div style="height:12px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin-top:8px;width:70%"></div></div>
        <div id="wd2" style="position:absolute;left:18px;top:86px;width:100px;height:40px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--coral);opacity:0;box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4)"></div></div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:22px"><span class="wb">Lists</span><span class="wb">Cards</span><span class="wb">Card panel</span><span class="wb">Drag &amp; drop</span></div></div>
    <!-- reason 4: testing -->
    <div class="lv" id="r4v">
      <div class="t4"><span class="tb4"></span>Drag a card<span class="tk4">✓</span></div>
      <div class="t4"><span class="tb4"></span>Edit in the panel<span class="tk4">✓</span></div>
      <div class="t4"><span class="tb4"></span>Refresh keeps it<span class="tk4">✓</span></div>
      <div id="t4saw" style="margin-top:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-weight:800;font-size:38px;color:var(--coral);opacity:0"><span class="ic" style="width:60px;height:60px">{{i:eye}}</span>Only if Claude SAW it work</div></div>
    <!-- the real prompt -->
    <div id="pp"><div class="pph"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>&nbsp; My prompt <span style="margin-left:auto;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(232,119,95,.18);color:var(--coralHi);font-size:16px">full text in the description</span></div>
      <div id="ppv"><div id="ppIn" class="mono">
        <div class="ps" id="psIntro">Using what you learned from the REA analysis of this Wekan demo board: boards.wekan.team/b/D2SzJKZDS4Z48yeQH/…<br><br>Build a faithful clone of its board screen in this folder. Name it "REA Board". Match the layout, colours, fonts, spacing and behaviour as closely as you can.</div>
        <div class="ps" id="psStack"><b>STACK</b><br><span class="phl">React 19 + Vite, no UI library, plain CSS</span>, native HTML5 drag and drop, state in one reducer file, everything saved in localStorage.</div>
        <div class="ps" id="psMeasure"><b class="phl">MEASURE FIRST, DON'T GUESS</b><br><span class="phl">Open the live demo and measure</span>: page and header colours, font family and sizes, list width and gap, card radius, shadow and padding, label colours, avatar size. <span class="phl">Put them in one CSS variables block</span> and use them everywhere.</div>
        <div class="ps" id="psBoard"><b>BOARD SCREEN</b><br>- Top bar with the board title, a board menu area and member avatars.<br>- <span class="phl">Horizontal row of lists</span> that scrolls sideways.<br>- Lists: title, card count, a WIP limit like (4/3).<br>- <span class="phl">Cards (minicards)</span>: auto ID, labels, four date badges, a CSS cover, avatars, checklist badge.</div>
        <div class="ps" id="psPanel"><b>CARD DETAIL PANEL</b><br><span class="phl">Edit title and description, labels, all four dates, members, cover colour, and checklists.</span></div>
        <div class="ps" id="psInter"><b>INTERACTIONS</b><br>- <span class="phl">Drag cards between lists</span> and reorder inside a list.<br>- Drag lists to reorder them.<br>- Refresh keeps everything.</div>
        <div class="ps" id="psTest"><b class="phl">TESTING</b><br>Run the dev server, then in a real browser <span class="phl">use real mouse drags</span> to test every feature. <span class="phl">Tick an item only if you saw it work.</span> Back up localStorage first and restore it afterwards.</div>
      </div></div></div>
  </div>
